  "zh": "1.5D 演化：加料 / 加热 / 驱动 / 台基 / 锯齿的开关，真的进装配了吗",
  "en": "1.5-D evolution: do the fuelling / heating / drive / pedestal / sawtooth switches reach the assembly?"
 },
